      "text": "Fragments  (8)\n• HomeFragment        — security score gauge\n• PillarsFragment     — ViewPager2 host\n   ├ Pillar1Fragment  (Supply Security)\n   ├ Pillar2Fragment  (Market Resilience)\n   ├ Pillar3Fragment  (Grid Reliability)\n   └ Pillar4Fragment  (Energy Transition)\n• AlertsFragment      — list + bottom-sheet\n• RecommendationsFragment\n• SettingsFragment",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": "rect-7",
      "originalText": "Fragments  (8)\n• HomeFragment        — security score gauge\n• PillarsFragment     — ViewPager2 host\n   ├ Pillar1Fragment  (Supply Security)\n   ├ Pillar2Fragment  (Market Resilience)\n   ├ Pillar3Fragment  (Grid Reliability)\n   └ Pillar4Fragment  (Energy Transition)\n• AlertsFragment      — list + bottom-sheet\n• RecommendationsFragment\n• SettingsFragment",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
