      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ViewModels  (7)\n\n• LoginViewModel\n   loginRequest → AuthRepository\n\n• HomeViewModel\n   refresh() · startAutoRefresh(30s)\n   exposes LiveData<SecurityScoreDto?>\n\n• PillarsViewModel\n   loads all 4 pillars in parallel\n\n• AlertsViewModel\n   alerts polling + acknowledge\n\n• RecommendationsViewModel\n   list + acknowledge action\n\n• SettingsViewModel\n   baseUrl · refresh interval · logout",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": "rect-11",
      "originalText": "ViewModels  (7)\n\n• LoginViewModel\n   loginRequest → AuthRepository\n\n• HomeViewModel\n   refresh() · startAutoRefresh(30s)\n   exposes LiveData<SecurityScoreDto?>\n\n• PillarsViewModel\n   loads all 4 pillars in parallel\n\n• AlertsViewModel\n   alerts polling + acknowledge\n\n• RecommendationsViewModel\n   list + acknowledge action\n\n• SettingsViewModel\n   baseUrl · refresh interval · logout",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
