      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Network Layer  data/network/\n\n• ApiService          (Retrofit interface, 13 endpoints)\n• NetworkModule       (OkHttp + Retrofit builder, recreatable)\n• AuthInterceptor     adds  Authorization: Bearer <token>\n• Moshi               KotlinJsonAdapterFactory · lenient\n• HttpLoggingInterceptor   BODY in DEBUG, BASIC in release\n\nPersistence  data/prefs/\n• TokenManager      SharedPreferences (jwt_token + user)\n• AppConfig         baseUrl + refreshIntervalSeconds",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": "rect-15",
      "originalText": "Network Layer  data/network/\n\n• ApiService          (Retrofit interface, 13 endpoints)\n• NetworkModule       (OkHttp + Retrofit builder, recreatable)\n• AuthInterceptor     adds  Authorization: Bearer <token>\n• Moshi               KotlinJsonAdapterFactory · lenient\n• HttpLoggingInterceptor   BODY in DEBUG, BASIC in release\n\nPersistence  data/prefs/\n• TokenManager      SharedPreferences (jwt_token + user)\n• AppConfig         baseUrl + refreshIntervalSeconds",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
